| find red_nether_brick_wall | position_near_with_facing | Find/locate task → player must navigate near AND face the target. max_distance=5 won't trigger at spawn (7.8 blocks away) but will trigger when player approaches within 5 blocks while looking at it. |
| find lime_terracotta | position_near_with_facing | Find/locate task → same logic. max_distance=5 won't trigger at spawn (6.4 blocks away) but will trigger when player is within 5 blocks facing the arch. |
| mine mossy_stone_brick_wall | inventory_has | Mine task → item ends up in inventory. Mossy stone brick wall drops itself when mined with any pickaxe. |
| mine polished_andesite_slab | inventory_has | Mine task → item ends up in inventory. Polished andesite slab drops itself when mined with any pickaxe. |

**Distance calibration note:** The find milestones use max_distance=5. Since the structures are 6.4-7.8 blocks from spawn, the player must walk at least 1.4-2.8 blocks toward the structure before the milestone can trigger. This ensures intentional navigation while being generous enough to not require the player to be right on top of the structure.

